hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18248","Affan narrated to us, Abd al-Wahid ibn Ziyad narrated to us, Asim al-Ahwal narrated to us, Kurayb ibn al-Harith ibn Abi Musa narrated to us from Abu Burdah ibn Qays brother of Abu Musa, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: O Allah, make the passing of my community killing in Your cause by piercing and plague."
